  "title": "TPG Appoints Axel André as Chief Financial Officer",
  "summary": "SAN FRANCISCO & FORT WORTH, TX – TPG Inc. (NASDAQ: TPG), a leading global alternative asset management firm, today announced that Axel André has been named Partner and Chief Financial Officer of TPG, effective July 27, 2026. Mr. André will succeed Jack Weingart, who will transition fully into his position as the CEO of TPG’s […]",
